    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d91">

                <pb facs="0250" n="165" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg165"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">639.003/60</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-08-08"><hi rendition="#italic">August 8,
                            1919</hi></date>.<lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received August
                        22.</hi>]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 492</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your No. 288 of May 27 (File
                    No. 639.003/53<anchor n="50" xml:id="d91-f1"/>), and to my reply thereto, No.
                    477 of July 6, I now have the honor <pb facs="0251" n="166" xml:id="pg166"/> to
                    enclose herewith a copy of the Preliminary Report and Recommendations of the
                    Tariff Commission,<anchor n="51" xml:id="d91-f2"/> and a copy of the final
                    instructions from the Military Governor to the Commission.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William W.
                    Russell</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d91-a1.xml" xpointer="d91-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d91-f1" n="50" xml:id="d91-f1-content">
                <p>Incorrect reference; should read 639.003/55.</p>
